Так, трижды ударам подверглись дата-центры «<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/Yandex_-_%D0%AF%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%81\">Яндекса</a>» - в <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A6%D0%A4%D0%9E_-_%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B6%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B3%D0%B0\">Калуге</a>, <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A6%D0%A4%D0%9E_-_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80\">Владимире</a> и городе <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A6%D0%A4%D0%9E_-_%D0%A0%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D0%A1%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BE%D0%BD_-_%D0%A1%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE\">Сасово</a> <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A6%D0%A4%D0%9E_-_%D0%A0%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C\">Рязанской области</a>. </p>\n\n<p>Также ударами подверглись <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A6%D0%9E%D0%94_-_%D0%A6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80_%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_-_%D0%94%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0-%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80_-_Data_Center\">дата-центры</a> <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80_-_%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BA_%D0%9F%D0%90%D0%9E_%D0%93%D0%9A_-_%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B9%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0